WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.353
Welcome to AVRASTRO CRM.

2
00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:06.359
On the web you sign in from the screen “Sign in to AVRASTRO CRM”,

3
00:00:06.661 --> 00:00:08.461
with your account e-mail and password,

4
00:00:08.461 --> 00:00:12.698
with a passkey, or with “Continue with avrastro.com”.

5
00:00:12.826 --> 00:00:17.086
The free trial lasts fourteen days, with no payment details.

6
00:00:18.186 --> 00:00:19.869
With “Set up my practice”

7
00:00:19.997 --> 00:00:24.187
you go through four steps, about two minutes, every step optional:

8
00:00:24.746 --> 00:00:26.939
the market, which sets currency,

9
00:00:26.998 --> 00:00:30.074
licensing fields, name days and checklists;

10
00:00:30.318 --> 00:00:34.137
your profile, with name, company and licence number;

11
00:00:34.602 --> 00:00:35.415
your logo;

12
00:00:35.415 --> 00:00:37.376
and your goals.

13
00:00:38.476 --> 00:00:39.579
Then the “Setup wizard”

14
00:00:39.579 --> 00:00:41.134
has seven short steps:

15
00:00:41.506 --> 00:00:43.990
profile and ICCS registration,

16
00:00:44.176 --> 00:00:47.833
with your classes, life, general or both;

17
00:00:48.286 --> 00:00:49.795
office and availability;

18
00:00:50.086 --> 00:00:51.385
import clients;

19
00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:52.964
calendar and e-mail;

20
00:00:53.267 --> 00:00:55.205
bookings on avrastro.com;

21
00:00:55.496 --> 00:00:56.830
which tools you see;

22
00:00:57.133 --> 00:00:58.572
backups and security.

23
00:00:58.816 --> 00:01:01.312
You can skip any step, and whatever is left

24
00:01:01.312 --> 00:01:04.446
shows as a start checklist on the Now screen.

25
00:01:05.546 --> 00:01:08.958
Your logo goes on proposals, reviews, letters and messages:

26
00:01:09.145 --> 00:01:12.929
your agency logo leads, and AVRASTRO appears discreetly.

27
00:01:13.232 --> 00:01:18.270
PNG, JPG, WebP or SVG, up to ten MB.

28
00:01:18.572 --> 00:01:20.859
A photo, signature and regulatory

29
00:01:20.859 --> 00:01:23.715
text are added in System, “Branding”.

30
00:01:24.815 --> 00:01:28.378
In the last step, reminders install the standard automations:

31
00:01:28.751 --> 00:01:32.662
follow-ups, renewals, birthdays, reviews.

32
00:01:32.907 --> 00:01:34.648
They create tasks for you;

33
00:01:34.834 --> 00:01:37.504
AVRASTRO never sends anything on its own.

34
00:01:37.876 --> 00:01:41.498
You review or switch them off in System, “Automations”.

35
00:01:42.598 --> 00:01:45.918
In the desktop app you can first look around with fictional clients,

36
00:01:45.942 --> 00:01:49.679
with “Load demo data”, and clear them later, or start empty.

37
00:01:49.982 --> 00:01:51.828
At the end, “Show me around”

38
00:01:51.828 --> 00:01:53.940
shows you the basics in one minute.

39
00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:55.863
All set.

40
00:01:56.108 --> 00:01:56.873
Press “?”

41
00:01:57.060 --> 00:01:58.789
for help on the screen you are on,

42
00:01:58.848 --> 00:02:01.332
and find these lessons in System, “Lessons”.

43
00:02:01.634 --> 00:02:03.967
In the next lesson you bring in your clients.
